<section class="hero is-success welcome">
  <div class="hero-body">
    <p class="eyebrow">A promise worth keeping</p>
    <h1 class="title is-1">Put your goals<br />into action.</h1>
    <p class="subtitle is-4">Make a public commitment. Stake ether.<br />Choose someone you trust to keep you accountable.</p>
    <a href="/new" class="button is-white is-medium">Create a challenge</a>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section how-it-works">
  <h2 class="title is-3">How CoinPledge works</h2>
  <div class="columns">
    <div class="column"><span class="step-number">1</span><h3 class="title is-5">Set a clear goal</h3><p>Choose a deadline and stake at least 0.01 ETH. Your commitment is recorded publicly on Ethereum.</p></div>
    <div class="column"><span class="step-number">2</span><h3 class="title is-5">Choose your mentor</h3><p>Ask someone you trust to register. Pick them as your mentor and set a reward budget for judging your result.</p></div>
    <div class="column"><span class="step-number">3</span><h3 class="title is-5">Follow through</h3><p>On success, your remaining stake becomes withdrawable. On failure, it goes into your bonus fund for future challenges.</p></div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section faq">
  <h2 class="title is-3">Before you pledge</h2>
  <details open><summary>Who decides the outcome?</summary><p>Your mentor can mark success or failure at any time. You can also resolve your own challenge from seven days after its deadline. Choose a mentor you trust: their decision is final.</p></details>
  <details><summary>How are rewards and bonuses calculated?</summary><p>The reward budget is deducted on either outcome. The service receives 10%, rounded down to whole wei; your mentor receives the rest. Success returns your remaining stake and half your bonus fund, rounded down. A bonus fund of 0.001 ETH or less is returned in full.</p></details>
  <details><summary>How do I receive my funds?</summary><p>Settlement credits your withdrawal balance. Open Account and choose Withdraw to wallet to collect it in a separate transaction. Gas is paid separately for each transaction.</p></details>
  <details><summary>What happens if CoinPledge shuts down?</summary><p>New registrations, challenges and donations stop permanently. Existing challenges can still be resolved, and bonus funds become withdrawable. Unresolved stakes still need resolution.</p></details>
  <details><summary>What do I need to get started?</summary><p>Use a browser wallet that exposes an Ethereum provider, connect to a network with a verified CoinPledge deployment, and fund your wallet. All goals and transactions are public. This version requires a new contract deployment; historical funds and challenges are not migrated.</p></details>
</section>
